  <data name="AiCategory_agent_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>"Smart partners" that write code, run commands, and edit files for you — install one and hand over your development work (works without a VPN; see the card notes).</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_agent_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>AI agents · Your AI dev partner</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_assistant_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Ask-and-answer AI companions for everyday questions, research, and writing — web versions work right away, and desktop apps keep one within reach. (Want AI that does the coding for you? See the "AI agents" category.)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_assistant_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Chat assistants · Chat / Search / Desktop apps</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_audio_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Make music, record voice-overs and podcasts, polish audio — from free professional tools to AI-generated sound, the whole world of audio in one place.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_audio_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Audio production · Music / Voice-over / Podcasts</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_create_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Shoot videos, edit films, design graphics, record podcasts — turn ideas into finished work with these tools; with the AI Assistant, even your copy and scripts get a hand.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_create_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Content creation · Social media / Editing / Art</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_dev_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Use AI to write code, build websites, and make small tools — below are the most common essentials for each kind of project; the AI Assistant will walk you through installing them step by step.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_dev_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Software development · Tools to pair with AI</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_game_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The main gear for making games with AI — the engine handles graphics and physics, AI helps you write scripts and logic, and you bring the ideas.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_game_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Game development · Tools to pair with AI</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_image_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>From photo retouching and illustration to UI design and AI image generation — designers and hobbyists alike will find handy tools here, installed and configured with the AI Assistant's help.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_image_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Image design · Drawing / Retouching / Design</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_local_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Completely free, with data never leaving your machine: local inference runtimes and one-click managers — install one and run open-source models offline (GPU-heavy; the assistant will recommend a size that fits your hardware). For cloud brains, see the "AI models" category.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_local_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Run AI locally · Models on your own PC</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_models_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>After you apply for a model API (DeepSeek recommended: inexpensive and directly reachable in China), the AI Assistant will help you wire it into Claude Code / Codex and other tools.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_models_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>AI models · The brains behind the tools</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_office_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Write documents, build spreadsheets, find files, watch videos — many of these free/open-source tools beat paid software, and the AI Assistant helps you install and set them up.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_office_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Productivity · Finish work sooner</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_translate_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Webpages / documents / video subtitles / live conversation — every translation scenario covered, and the free ones beat the paid ones.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_translate_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Translation tools · Read foreign languages without the headache</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AiCategory_video_Description" xml:space="preserve">
