  <data name="Gt_L146.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The game runs on my computer; my friend joins in one click</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L149.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pick a game → send the invite code to your friend → he joins the same virtual LAN and gets your online address. The port and in-game steps are prepared automatically.</value>
  </data>
