  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L189.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>My friend hosts; I join his virtual network</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L192.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Paste the invite code your friend sent (pasting the whole message works too); if Tailscale isn't installed it's set up automatically. Once on the network, use the port shown on the game card and join him via “Join via IP” in the game.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L198.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Paste an invite code to join</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L209.Text" xml:space="preserve">
