  <data name="Gt_L207.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>· “Unknown host / server not responding”: return to the game's main menu and try again, or have your friend confirm the game is still running.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L212.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>· Still can't connect: go back to the Toolbox home page and click “Network Check” to see whether you're direct or relayed and whether there are warnings.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L217.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>· To restore normal networking after playing: right-click the Tailscale tray icon and choose Disconnect, or switch back to your own account from the tray menu.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L34.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Online play uses Tailscale to put both computers on one virtual LAN — low latency, no router changes. It takes just two things: install the client and sign in once.</value>
