    <value>Create a key manually</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L62.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Generate it on the console's Keys page; it starts with tskey-api-. The token is stored only in this machine's data directory and is used to create invite keys automatically.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Gt_L67.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>No need to paste manually: click “Copy” in the console and come back to this window — it fills in and verifies automatically.</value>
